<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Survey Confirmation</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lexend:wght@300;400;500&display=swap');

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Lexend', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
            color: #2c3234;
        }

        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }

        .header {
            background-color: #1795d4;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .header img {
            max-width: 200px;
            height: auto;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #22567c;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin: 0 0 20px 0;
        }

        p {
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0 0 15px 0;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        .details-box {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            border-left: 4px solid #1795d4;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }

        .details-box p {
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        .details-label {
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #22567c;
        }

        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #1795d4;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .cta-button:hover {
            background-color: #22567c;
        }

        .footer {
            background-color: #2c3234;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .footer p {
            margin: 5px 0;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        .footer a {
            color: #1795d4;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .privacy-notice {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }

        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .content {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="header">
            <img src="https://www.equalexperts.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/2024-Logo.svg" alt="Equal Experts Logo">
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <h1>Thank you for your feedback!</h1>

            <p>Your survey response has been successfully submitted. We appreciate you taking the time to share your thoughts about the {{surveyName}}.</p>

            <div class="details-box">
                <p><span class="details-label">Survey:</span> {{surveyName}}</p>
                <p><span class="details-label">Submitted:</span> {{submissionTimestamp}}</p>
                <p><span class="details-label">Submission ID:</span> {{submissionId}}</p>
            </div>

            <h2 style="color: #22567c; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; margin-top: 30px;">Results Timeline</h2>
            <p>{{resultsTimeline}}</p>

            <p style="margin-top: 25px;">When results are available, you can access them at:</p>
            <a href="{{resultsUrl}}" class="cta-button">View Results</a>

            <p style="margin-top: 30px;">If you have any questions about your submission, please contact us at:</p>
            <p><a href="mailto:{{contactEmail}}" style="color: #1795d4; text-decoration: none;">{{contactEmail}}</a></p>

            <div class="privacy-notice">
                <p><strong>Privacy Notice:</strong> This email address was collected solely for the purpose of sending you this confirmation. We will not share your email address with third parties or use it for any other purpose without your explicit consent.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Equal Experts</p>
            <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 10px;">This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
